<div class="prose reveal"><h2>What we believe.</h2><p>Every product we make is a bet on the future. We pour candles from 100% soy wax because it's renewable, burns cleaner than paraffin, and supports American farmers. We use phthalate-free fragrance oils because you shouldn't have to compromise your health for your home to smell beautiful.</p></div>
<div class="split reveal"><div><span class="num">01</span><h3>Refillable systems</h3><p>Our ceramic vessels are designed to be refilled indefinitely. Bring your empty vessel to our studio for a discounted refill, or ship it back to us and we'll return it filled.</p></div><div><span class="num">02</span><h3>Recycled packaging</h3><p>Every box is made from 87% post-consumer recycled cardboard. Our tissue paper is FSC-certified. Our tape is paper-based.</p></div></div>
<div class="split reveal"><div><span class="num">03</span><h3>Local supply chain</h3><p>Our ceramic vessels are thrown by three ceramicists within 40 miles of our studio. Our wax comes from a single American farm we've worked with since 2020.</p></div><div><span class="num">04</span><h3>Carbon-aware shipping</h3><p>We consolidate orders where possible, ship ground by default, and offset every shipment through verified carbon projects.</p></div></div>
</div>
